        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Mediator and does not receive a more favorable determination by the arbitrator, the other party shall be considered the prevailing party. Expenses and verified costs of the prevailing party shall be borne by the other party, including cost of the arbitrator, reporting, and cost of meeting rooms incurred as the result of arbitration. In all other areas the parties will share the respective costs, one-half (1/2) to be borne by each side. Cost of attorney fees and the publication of the transcript shall be borne by the party incurring the fees.",
